;; Simon's crypt (campaign only, docs/HEROES.md): a high gothic room. Since 0.4.52 it is an area
;; of 5-1 (its id kept, so saves and codes stay valid): the locked door in 5-1-bonus, opened with
;; the key, leads down into it, and the player drops in onto the landing at the top left; a stair
;; of castle stone leads down to the floor, where captive Simon kneels under the spell (11,11)
;; beneath the stained glass, candles either side. The dark doorway in the right wall (rows
;; 10-11) leads back out to 5-1, up out of the coin room's pipe at column 163, with the clock
;; running on. Column 16 is the doorway's back wall, just off the locked screen.

